    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d117">

                <pb facs="0251" n="139" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg139"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-09T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 9, 1918, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6202. Your January 1, 2 p.m., No. 8116. The report communicated by Foreign Office
                    December 31 to effect that Japanese group had decided to defer the making of
                    proposed advance is proved incorrect. American Legation at Peking January 7
                    informs Department that loan was signed January 6.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
